1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,465
All my friends got jobs. I still haven't.

2
00:00:02,765 --> 00:00:07,156
Golu, what does the whole city queue up for? Pani puri! Start a cart!

3
00:00:07,456 --> 00:00:09,090
Pani puri? How much will that cost?

4
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:13,704
Cart, pots and utensils, all for ₹15,000.

5
00:00:14,004 --> 00:00:19,688
Keep it clean! Wear gloves and use filtered water. A clean cart draws double the crowd.

6
00:00:20,238 --> 00:00:24,942
Bhaiya, extra spicy! And the last dry puri is free!

7
00:00:25,242 --> 00:00:29,553
Six puris for ₹40. And the dry puri is free for you, madam!

8
00:00:29,853 --> 00:00:37,922
Four evening hours, a hundred plates. Half is profit, so ₹1,500 to ₹2,000 a day.

9
00:00:38,222 --> 00:00:43,988
Add dahi puri and chaat. And take wedding orders. One party pays like a whole week.

10
00:00:44,288 --> 00:00:46,887
Golu's pani puri is in full demand! Life set!
